description	"Commander Thorn

A heavy suppression tank built for choke point lockdowns and crowd control.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples On Hit
-- Fast Movement
- Z-6 'Hammer' Blaster Cannon (Minigun 1)
-- 10% More Damage
-- 40% Faster RoF
-- 10% Higher FP Drain
-- Cripples On Hit
-- Mag Reload
- PLX-1 Flash Suppressor (3)
-- 3-Round Clip (9 Ammo Total)
-- 95% Less Damage
-- 20% Faster Velocity
-- Flashes/Cripples/Knocks Back/Stuns/Tracks/Sonic On Hit

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)
- Healing (2)
- Blast Armour
- Stamina (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Get Ups (3)
- Anti MT (2)
- Melee Resist
- 50% Less Knockback Taken
- Security Detail (Stat Viewer)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS1]
- Barge ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS4]"